  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity for Economic Research and Policy making in Africa (CERPA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase the  number and quality of MSc and Phd Economics graduates in developing countries involved in research and policy activities,  and to improve ability of developing country researchers to undertake high quality economic research. This will enable developing countries to manage their economies better, which should help them to  achieve higher economic growth.</narrative>
  </description>
